#
# PING - baseline (no arg) and with optional message (Redis spec)
#
PONG
hello
with spaces
#
# ECHO - short arg, with spaces, empty string, digit-like arg
#
hello
with spaces

12345
#
# CONFIG GET - Rondis does not expose any tunable parameters, so
# every pattern yields the Redis-canonical empty array reply.
# Multi-pattern form is accepted (arity >= 3).
#



#
# CONFIG with unsupported subcommand - Redis-canonical error
#
ERR Unknown subcommand or wrong number of arguments for 'SET'. Try CONFIG HELP.

#
# SELECT - valid database (Rondis exposes at least db 0)
#
OK
